---
title: "withdrawRaisedCapital (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_caller: project admin withdraws capital
    q_check_caller --> q_check_ended: caller is projectAdmin
    q_check_caller --> q_revert_auth: unauthorized
    q_check_ended --> q_check_refund: hasEnded == true
    q_check_ended --> q_revert_not_ended: sale not ended
    q_check_refund --> q_check_published: block.timestamp >= refundEndTime
    q_check_refund --> q_revert_refund: refund period not ended
    q_check_published --> q_check_not_withdrawn: raisedCapital has been published
    q_check_published --> q_revert_not_published: raised capital not published
    q_check_not_withdrawn --> q_calc_fees: capital not already withdrawn
    q_check_not_withdrawn --> q_revert_withdrawn: already withdrawn
    q_calc_fees --> q_distribute: legionFee + referrerFee calculated from raisedCapital
    q_distribute --> q_mark: transfer fees and project amount
    q_mark --> [*]: capitalWithdrawn = true, emit CapitalWithdrawn(projectAmount, legionFee, referrerFee)
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_revert_not_ended --> [*]: revert SaleNotEnded
    q_revert_refund --> [*]: revert RefundPeriodNotEnded
    q_revert_not_published --> [*]: revert RaisedCapitalNotPublished
    q_revert_withdrawn --> [*]: revert AlreadyWithdrawn

    note right of q_calc_fees
        INV-001: Capital withdrawal possible before token supply (early access for projects)
        INV-002: Once capital withdrawn, vesting term modifications prohibited
    end note
